    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1573">

                <pb facs="1163" n="1047" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1047"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 012/3749.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consular Agent Glenn to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guanajuato</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 16, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I would thank you to kindly advise me your
                    wishes as regards Spanish religious institutions and Spaniards in general. There
                    is no Spanish Consul in this State and I have had very many requests <pb
                        facs="1164" n="1048" xml:id="pg1048"/> from Spaniards for assistance, they
                    claiming that in Guadalajara and other parts they are under the protection of
                    the American flag.</p>
                <p>Awaiting [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">John B. Glenn.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
